    <string name="onboarding_title">Welcome to NFriend</string>
    <string name="onboarding_subtitle">Privacy-first proximity. No accounts. No cloud.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_explanation">NFriend is designed to keep you safe.\n\n• Your identity is stored only on this device.\n• All chats and location pins are End-to-End Encrypted.\n• Messages are ephemeral and vanish after 10 minutes.\n\nSimply scan a friend\'s QR code in person to connect!</string>
